msgid "This must be received as a real ledger payment before approval."
msgstr ""
"این مبلغ باید پیش از تأیید، به‌عنوان پرداخت واقعی در دفتر مالی ثبت و دریافت "
"شود."

msgid ""
"The financed balance is divided across this many payments. Use one "
"installment for a simple remaining customer balance or short-term loan."
